<%- include('../../partials/header',{title}) %><div class="wa-chatbot"><h1>Simulation inscription WhatsApp</h1><%- include('_chatbot-nav',{section:'admissions'}) %><p>Utilisez des coordonnées fictives. Aucune demande, inscription, notification ni livraison n’est créée ; l’action de transmission reste simulée. Les données de catalogue sont lues normalement.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/whatsapp/admissions/simulator"><%- csrfField() %><input type="hidden" name="reset" value="on"><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">Recommencer</button></form>
<% if(simulation){ %><% simulation.history.forEach(t=>{ %><article class="card"><small><%= t.input %></small><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><%= t.text||'Aucune réponse automatique.' %></p><p>Actions simulées : <%= t.actions.join(', ')||'aucune' %></p></article><% }); %><% const choices=simulation.interactive?.type==='button'?simulation.interactive.action.buttons.map(b=>b.reply):simulation.interactive?.action.sections[0].rows||[];choices.forEach(o=>{ %><form method="post" action="/admin/whatsapp/admissions/simulator"><%- csrfField() %><input type="hidden" name="interactionId" value="<%= o.id %>"><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit"><%= o.title %></button></form><% }); %><form method="post" action="/admin/whatsapp/admissions/simulator"><%- csrfField() %><label>Message / numéro<input name="text" maxlength="1000" required></label><button class="button" type="submit">Tester</button></form><% } %></div><%- include('../../partials/footer') %>
